{
 "encounter_id": "00810",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "G'day, doc. Bloody nuisance, this, I'm up four times a night for a pee, and my wife's had enough, she's moved to the spare room, and the dog's been sick too, we had to take him to the vet on Monday..."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Sorry to hear about the dog. Four times a night. How long's that been going on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Six months, mate, give or take. Started with two times, now it's four."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And when you're at the toilet, how's the flow?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Weak. Slow to start, and then it dribbles. I stand there like a statue."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything after you've finished?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yeah, dribbling after. Down the leg, embarrassing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any burning when you go?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No burning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any blood in the urine?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No blood, I've checked. Well, I think I've checked. No."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Are you thirsty all the time?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Nah, not really."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Back pain?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No back pain. That's the one thing that's fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What tablets are you on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Amlodipine, 5 mg, once a day. I take it every day, religiously. Well. Except when I'm out on the boat, then I forget it for a couple of days."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "So not quite every day. Allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Bactrim. I react to it, but don't ask me how, I can't remember what it did."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. Conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High blood pressure, gout, and kidney stones, years back."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Kidney stone removed, in 2009. Hernia, in 2015."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Dad had prostate cancer. My brother has diabetes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you do?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Retired farmer. Still go out to the sheds every day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Drink?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Four beers, Friday and Saturday."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check your numbers. Pulse 70, blood pressure 144 over 88, temperature 36.7, oxygen 98 percent, breathing 14, weight 92 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Bit high, eh? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A little. Hop on the bed. I'm feeling your tummy.",
   "pause": 8.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Cold hands. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your abdomen is soft, and I can't feel your bladder, so you're emptying it reasonably."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Reasonably? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'm also going to do a rectal exam. It's quick.",
   "pause": 12.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh, here we go. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The prostate is smooth, but enlarged."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. Is that why? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And there's no swelling in your ankles. Any trouble breathing, mate?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing, my breathing's fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "An enlarged prostate fits, but I can't rule out diabetes or kidney trouble yet."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it cancer? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It could be nothing. I'd like to arrange a PSA blood test, and an ultrasound scan of your bladder and kidneys."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "When? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "This week. And I'd like to start tamsulosin, 400 micrograms, once a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Will it stop the toilet trips? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It should help. Cut the beer after dinner, too."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ah, that's the hard part. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in two weeks with the results."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Two weeks. Cheers, doc. ~"
  }
 ],
